# Classic (full) context menu on Windows 11. HKCU only, no shell replacement.
# Revert deletes the CLSID key we created (topmost_missing in core.cmd).
UI-CLASSIC-CONTEXT|extended|low|win11|REG|@HKCU@\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}\InprocServer32|@DEFAULT@|REG_SZ|@EMPTY@

# --- performance -----------------------------------------------------------
PERF-NETTHROTTLE|balanced|low|any|REG|HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\Multimedia\SystemProfile|NetworkThrottlingIndex|REG_DWORD|0xffffffff

# --- Windows Update: defer feature updates only, never disable updates ------
UPD-NOREBOOT|balanced|low|any|REG|HKLM\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\WindowsUpdate\AU|NoAutoRebootWithLoggedOnUsers|REG_DWORD|1
UPD-DO-LAN|balanced|low|any|REG|HKLM\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\DeliveryOptimization|DODownloadMode|REG_DWORD|1
